[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11532.95, "timestamp": "03:12:12", "text": "911。我的意思是，例如，Sora。我爱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11535.99, "timestamp": "03:12:15", "text": "索拉。我一直在看索拉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11538.78, "timestamp": "03:12:18", "text": "好像已经过了很久了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11541.349, "timestamp": "03:12:21", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11544.469, "timestamp": "03:12:24", "text": "你知道这件事最令人悲哀的地方是什么吗？那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11547.51, "timestamp": "03:12:27", "text": "给 Sora 剪头发的剪发师不多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11549.19, "timestamp": "03:12:29", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11552.07, "timestamp": "03:12:32", "text": "这让我很生气，因为每次我检查的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11553.91, "timestamp": "03:12:33", "text": "理发师们会说：“啊，会有的。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11556.07, "timestamp": "03:12:36", "text": "像 Picora 那样剪辑其他人的作品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11557.51, "timestamp": "03:12:37", "text": "我不是在抱怨，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11559.91, "timestamp": "03:12:39", "text": "“哦，别剪它们，剪这个。”但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11562.23, "timestamp": "03:12:42", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11564.309, "timestamp": "03:12:44", "text": "索拉做了很多搞笑的事情，很有趣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11566.95, "timestamp": "03:12:46", "text": "还有其他东西。我会看到的，我会看到的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11569.67, "timestamp": "03:12:49", "text": "就像她在直播中发出的“呃呃”声。我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11571.91, "timestamp": "03:12:51", "text": "“我的天，那场直播太有趣了。”我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11576.23, "timestamp": "03:12:56", "text": "到那时，就不会有剪辑片段了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11577.83, "timestamp": "03:12:57", "text": "就像一两​​个片段，当……"}]